Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:04.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道小卡做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what Cass did?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.69,0:00:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟脑子里那道屏障没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dam inside your brother's head is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有地狱的记忆都倾巢而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all hell's spilling loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当我一闭眼 路西法就冲我大喊大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I close my eyes, Lucifer is yelling into my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.71,0:00:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 越南\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Vietnam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他并不是真的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he's not actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话跟我脑袋里的音量控制开关说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try telling that to the volume control inside my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没再试试掐伤口那招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you try the hand thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大哥哥也许已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big brother's probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我说「闭嘴」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said "shut up" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我 搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信我搞定你了 铺友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe I've got you, bunk buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你可不能睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No nap for you, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:46.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会说英语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak friggin' English?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人追我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你跑什么 - 就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you running up in here like that? - Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.70,0:01:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你磕什么药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did you take, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没磕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上瓶啤酒的劲早就过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burned through that last beer hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.37,0:01:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约就在迪恩睡过去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right about the time Dean passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛 萨姆 告诉这个好心的瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam. Tell the nice tweaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.17,0:01:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是魔王对你寸步不离\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be sleeping by now if the devil would just.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在早睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave you alone for five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.27,0:01:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌的撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路追你到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chasing you all the way to…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,掐掐手上的疤啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the hand scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几天没睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many days you been up, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,四天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 收回那句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Wait. Scratch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是五天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 先别走 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hold up! Wait! Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想嗨吗 我可以给你点药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to knock out? I can knock you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 祝你早安 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Good morning to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 祝你早安 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Good morning to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 崭新的一天已降临 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Our day is beginning ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 祝你早安 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So good morning to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你喜欢听我唱歌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you liked my singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗑药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你这是给自己帮倒忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do get that you're just bringing free drugs to the party, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活在你脑袋里 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am inside you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常人类连续不睡觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the longest a normal human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高纪录是多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}has ever gone without sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}11 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直想做正常人 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always wanted to be normal, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是正常人 那一周内就死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are, you'll be dead in a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第17集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 没有预约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sir? You can't just barge in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能擅自闯进来 - 他们让我找卡丁斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}- without an appointment! - They said, "Talk to Kadinsky."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是卡丁斯基吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Kadinsky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要先预约 - 那就帮我安排啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to be scheduled! - Well, then, schedule me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出了车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in a car crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我凭什么不能见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell can't I see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是萨姆·史密斯的哥哥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Sam Smith's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 谢谢你 真没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's fine. Thank you. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆住院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam was admitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肋骨骨折 还有撕裂伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was treated for a broken rib and lacerations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 情况不算太糟 还有呢 - 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. That's not too bad. And? - And…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我们封闭精神科住院\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on our locked psychiatric floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他虽然是有点问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's had some trouble…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说你知道萨姆正在经受\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're aware that Sam is experiencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神病发作的折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}a full-blown psychotic episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychotic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 我弟弟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I mean, the guy's…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟又不是什么精神病患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like the guy's freakin' Norman Bates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他肯定不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sure he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要进一步确定他目前的症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to determine whether his state.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否由失眠引起\N{\fnArial\fs30}was brought on by the insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说失眠只是他精神病的一种症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}or whether the insomnia is a symptom of his condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗 以便我们制定治疗计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand? So that we can figure out how to treat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道他是最近才开始失眠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all I can say is that the sleep thing is kind of new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已给他注射了最大安全剂量的镇定剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've pumped him about as full of sedatives as we safely can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可目前他还是清醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, he won't go under.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真没见过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:58.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（高度戒备区）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没灵魂那会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back when you had no soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来用不着睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never had to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,无助先生来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mr. Helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,带酒来没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up a six-pack, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概参加不了终极格斗大赛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should cancel my UFC fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 保持这种幽默感 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Keep that sense of humor, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮你渡过难关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll get you through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我会找医生帮你治病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I'm gonna find you help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像不太信服啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that sounded a little cynical.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得没人能帮上我 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's out there, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们心里最清楚不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know better than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是些骗人的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all snake oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们上次碰到的信仰治疗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last faith healer we hooked up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,使咒抓了个死神给她干活 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a reaper on a leash. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想让我帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you don't want my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这么折磨自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't do this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:05:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 如果我找不到人帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, if I don't find something …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说得人家都郁闷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're upsetting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.69,0:06:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 你知道这是迟早的事 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, we knew this was coming. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你帮我找回灵魂的时候就知道 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When you put my soul back. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡警告过你会发生什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass warned you about all the crap it would …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别这么淡定好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit being Dali Frickin' Yoda about this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点火气行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get pissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm too tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.01,0:06:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把人的灵魂跟路西法关一起就会变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what happens when you throw a soul into Lucifer's dog bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真以为会有救吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you think there's just gonna be some cure out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩挺感伤的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you guys are having a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是鲍比·辛格的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a friend of Bobby Singer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想查些信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for some info.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能帮忙 请回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could, uh, call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,785-555-0128\N{\fnArial\fs30}785-555-0128.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry to have bothered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.39,0:07:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,自恋型人格障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Narcissistic personality disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我可能有这条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, this one I could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该吃药了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for meds, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定不现实的目标 有这条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sets unrealistic goals. Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是「不能和他人保持健康的关系」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But "trouble keeping healthy relationships?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一条我不是很确定 你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so sure about that one. Thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hi. Uh… my name's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:04.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（麦基的标本公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是鲍比·辛格的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a friend of Bobby Singer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想查些信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, looking for some info.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能帮我请回电7855550128\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could call me back at 785-555-0128.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.81,0:08:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 今天感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, how are we feeling today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一到十级来形容你肋骨的疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rib pain … scale of 1 to 10?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不那么疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's … it's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,三级吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}3.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用不着撒谎的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to lie, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在忍受着巨大的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've suffered terrible agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来你的十级一定难以想象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your 10 must be astronomical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.01,0:08:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我想我比较能忍疼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I-I guess I have a high threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是最糟的部分是知道没有最疼只有更疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the worst is knowing that there's always a new 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是我今天为你准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm talking about the truly elegant torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的痛苦的折磨 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have prepared for you today, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay the hell away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是咱们刚才聊得多好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's … it's so nice chatting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你不理我真让我伤心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I hate these one-sided conversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计 来单挑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy. Engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}me…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,关在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道只有我感觉这就像个笼子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it me, or is this just like the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是麦基 给你回电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}MacKey. Calling you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比的事我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Real sorry about Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打电话说的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what you called about …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能有对你有用的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个家伙 叫伊曼纽尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this guy. He goes by "Emanuel."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kind of roams.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月前开始听说他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}First started hearing about him a couple of months back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能治愈伤者 包括那些疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he was healing the sick, curing the crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说 我觉得这家伙肯定有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally, I think something in the milk ain't clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是打算找到他 让他收摊滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find this sucker, punch his clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.39,0:10:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说想找他最好的办法就是通过他妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard the best way to get to him is through his wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫达芙妮 在科罗拉多州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daphne, out in Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她我快瞎了 这倒是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her I'm going blind. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的右眼快完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My right eye's burnt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说 「你回家吧 他会去的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says, "Go home. He'll come."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.03,0:10:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我就回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我布置了所有能找到的陷阱和测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set every trap, every test in the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我也会这么干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊曼纽尔出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emanuel shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:10:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他通过了所有陷阱和测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}He passes every one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't nothing weird about this guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}except…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真有两下子\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他碰了我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He touched me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼睛就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my eye was fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得这有点不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't believe in much that don't suck your blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不确定也不会打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wouldn't call you on a maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我头疼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, my head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来吧「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it stop!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want this or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨天见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像不怎么喜欢这的饭菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't look too happy with your in-flight meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是玛琳 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marin. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是萨姆 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「对\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我是萨姆 你好」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm Sam. Hi."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 这是达芙妮·艾伦的家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Uh, is this, uh, Daphne Allen's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来找伊曼纽尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Emanuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,达芙妮在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daphne's resting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出来说行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I was hoping…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.37,0:12:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你就三思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'd think twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道你老大放话说不能碰我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or don't you know that your boss issued a hands-off memo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近为他做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done for him lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把罗曼的头砍下来了 没有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman's head on a plate? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管伊曼纽尔是什么 克劳力肯定想要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever Emanuel is, Crowley's gonna want him …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,相对来说他目前肯定没那么稀罕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot more than he wants you these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.19,0:12:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.11,0:13:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪物伤了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That creature hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 伊曼纽尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Emanuel…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是冲你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是伊曼纽尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Emanuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. I'm…Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你保护我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for protecting my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见他的脸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真正的面容\N{\fnArial\fs30}His real face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,人间居然出了一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon walked the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一大群恶魔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whackloads of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know about…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了恶魔的真身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the demon's true face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊曼纽尔天赋秉异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emanuel has very special gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我 我听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I-I've heard that about…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊曼纽尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emanuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能治愈人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you can heal people up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我似乎在一定程度上能帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to be able to help to a certain degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇到了什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.52,0:14:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实在的 你比我想的要坚强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're actually keeping it together better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像 身负重压 却还能坚持得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of…the way someone pinned under a bus keeps it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.44,0:14:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 你知道什么才是最糟的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet… you know what really sucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的疯狂赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your madness won.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那个一度拯救世界的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were the guy that saved the world once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm! Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天吃什么 还吃蛆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'll be today? Maggots again,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.55,0:15:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是绦虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}or, uh, tapeworm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.11,0:15:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫玛琳的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl, uh, Marin…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这话我真的不该讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not really supposed to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧 她不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say, unlike you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可不是因意外事故入院的\N{\fnArial\fs30}she didn't get here 'cause of no accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:15:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,达芙妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Daphne …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that, uh, your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她找到了我 并照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She found me and cared for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.15,0:16:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个 奇怪的故事 你可能不会喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a…strange story. You may not like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月前 她到河边远足\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few months ago, she was hiking by the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我徘徊到她面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wandered into her path,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身湿透 迷迷糊糊 还 一丝不挂\N{\fnArial\fs30}drenched and confused, and…unclothed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失忆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.62,0:16:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝希望她找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God wanted her to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁给你取名伊曼纽尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who named you Emanuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.93,0:16:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在快活宝贝起名网上找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bouncybabynames.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺适合你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's working for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.23,0:16:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道自己是谁一定很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be weird not knowing who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是很棒的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a good life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.65,0:16:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, what if you were some kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:16:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说 是个坏蛋怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know…bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不感觉自己是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I… don't feel like a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.09,0:17:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你还真是铁了心不睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you must be really determined to wait out nap time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 和我一起吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Uh… share this with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.85,0:17:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道为什么我为自己偷的糖感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I'm thanking you for a candy bar I stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前五周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five weeks and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.30,0:17:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打破住院记录了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么入院\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说不重要 却贴着那么多纱布\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of bandages for "It doesn't matter."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听听医生的说法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the doctor answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神压抑导致产生轻生的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm psychotically depressed to a suicidal ideation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:17:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真实情况是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the not doctor answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是 想结束它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… want it to be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 说我我还年轻 生活充满希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Tell me I'm young, and have everything to live for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说怎么能让你信服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的也对\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有些声音让你无法睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the voices won't let you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实只有一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.07,0:18:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如查理·曼森（杀死大导演波兰斯基家人的凶犯）还是撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Charlie Manson or the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听到一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你放火的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you set the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人 你脖子上的是烧伤 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one. T-They're burns, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我放的火 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't set the fire, o… he did!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道我为什么说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I don't even know why I'm talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛琳 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marin, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.23,0:19:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我还疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are crazier than I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·曼森告诉你该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles Manson tells you what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我听到的是自己哥哥的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least it's my own brother …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.05,0:19:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉真糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sucks…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死去的哥哥跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it's your dead brother saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你自杀来陪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill yourself to be with him…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他就亲自动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or he'll do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.85,0:19:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生对他的诊断是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his diagnosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实不是医学病症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not exactly medical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能治愈心灵的疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can cure illness of a spiritual origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spiritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人害他变成了这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone did this to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.11,0:20:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那家伙弄坏了我弟弟的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah. Dude broke my brother's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人背叛了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He betrayed you, this dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他原来是你的朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.34,0:20:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到你杀过很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense that you kill a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.35,0:20:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我 我不知道他是否死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I-I don't know if he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know that this…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事糟得不能再糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}whole thing couldn't be messier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 我以前总能把这种事放在身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I used to be able to just shake this stuff off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, whatever it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许需要点时间 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might take me some time, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可小卡做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Cass did…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为什么 我就是迈不过这个坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't … I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it doesn't matter why.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不是台机器 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're not a machine, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友叫小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend's name was Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字好怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an odd name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐这儿别动 我就出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, sit tight. I'll be right out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.63,0:22:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊曼纽尔 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emanuel, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊曼纽尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emanuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.52,0:22:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.62,0:22:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 迪恩 你得好好解释解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Dean, Dean. You got some 'splainin' to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.56,0:22:50.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（停业）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个伊曼纽尔的事迹传的满天飞啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumors are really starting to fly about this Emanuel fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是好奇得不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My curiosity sure got revved up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就直说你想干嘛吧 梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what you want, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.95,0:23:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他时 却发现他小鸟依人地跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine my surprise when I track him down,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.72,0:23:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想我有多惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's snuggled up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他长得跟已故的可怜虫卡西迪奥一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's the spitting image of poor, dead Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.87,0:23:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 可怜的卡西迪奥都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dean, what's poor, dead Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会出现在外面的那辆破车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}doing in that junker out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱圣诞颂歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas caroling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.25,0:23:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真风趣 他怎么会还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun. But how's he alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.93,0:23:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 他扮演上帝 结果爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I heard, he played God, went poof.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他也不知道 所以你少多嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And neither does he, so you got to keep it shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.07,0:23:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.04,0:23:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道他是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know he's Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.93,0:23:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我盯了你们几小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Been watching you for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.26,0:23:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这么办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.24,0:23:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我和克劳力以前的关系不怎么样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might remember Crowley and me were frosty back in the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在也没改善 - 那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, times haven't changed. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真伤我感情 我可待你不薄 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurts my feelings. I've been good to you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是关照自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you've been good to you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.50,0:23:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.51,0:23:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前关于这个云游治疗师的谣言传得还不算远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, rumors of this wandering healer are strictly low-level.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是死了这么多人 纸包不住火\N{\fnArial\fs30}But body count's getting high enough to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.13,0:23:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人开始四处打探 他们闻得到天使的味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks start poking, they sniff angel dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.90,0:23:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了跑去克劳力那儿邀功都能挤死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they start falling all over each other trying to tell Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想克劳力要是抓到温良无害的失忆小卡会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now picture Crowley with his hands on harmless little amnesia Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.59,0:23:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.58,0:24:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了那个口蜜腹剑的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna burn that smarmy dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.32,0:24:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐就要称霸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My time's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我目前孤军奋战 所以说我实力还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right about now, my army-of-one situation is not cutting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.39,0:24:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,形势严峻 杀我者有赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cold out here, there's a price on my ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我需要盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.18,0:24:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.57,0:24:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不是你的盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I ain't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.73,0:24:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你就错了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where you're wrong, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.72,0:24:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮你的 这样一来我们就是朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm here to help you, and that makes us friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.33,0:24:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想看看能不能把外面那个温良无害的小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean see if you can't turn harmless little Cass out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成全能天使大杀器吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}into an angel-sized weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.29,0:24:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装得好像你对他没企图似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're taking him caroling.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.69,0:24:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 你真想不带后援就继续上路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way, you really want to keep going with no backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.57,0:24:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I don't trust you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我用得上伊曼纽尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I could really use Emanuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.71,0:24:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.74,0:24:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在我们联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for now, it's in everyone's best interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.58,0:24:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对大家都有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hold hands and cross the street together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.18,0:24:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们直接去找萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go straight to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.06,0:24:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去别处\N{\fnArial\fs30}No detours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.40,0:24:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此甚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.23,0:24:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还我刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.47,0:25:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟气场全开的天使结伴旅行不是更安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure we wouldn't be safer traveling with a full-throttle Angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.50,0:25:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让他都记起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could jog his memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.15,0:25:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,逗你玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.23,0:25:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不想惹那小可怜难过嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't want to upset the poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.84,0:25:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的脸 她是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her face! She's one of …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.39,0:25:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 坏蛋还分三六九等呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. We come in different flavors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.81,0:25:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是 我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's, uh…A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.06,0:25:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.14,0:25:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来精神支持你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just here for moral support.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.12,0:25:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我们交情老深了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, after all, we go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.07,0:25:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说迪恩和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.37,0:25:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你当然是初次相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just met you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.22,0:25:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想我们也会成为好朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're gonna be good friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Can we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.72,0:25:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛琳 玛琳 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marin. Marin, hey. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.85,0:26:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 惹你难过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…I'm sorry I upset you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.09,0:26:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,能问你点事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.77,0:26:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.49,0:26:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,火灾的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.77,0:26:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你虽是好意 但你根本不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. You mean well, but you have no idea …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.48,0:26:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说不是你点的火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you didn't start it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.10,0:26:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛琳 我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you, Marin,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.00,0:26:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他不能再伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he tries to hurt you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.89,0:26:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色更差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.47,0:26:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的器官需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your organs need sleep, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.53,0:26:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样下去 你的头发和指甲会脱落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hair and nails are gonna fall out,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.71,0:26:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,肾脏会停止工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your kidneys are gonna shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.19,0:26:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在电影里看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it in a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.13,0:26:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.30,0:26:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um, your brother …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.78,0:26:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么时候死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when did he pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.20,0:26:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.92,0:26:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.95,0:26:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.21,0:26:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}he just talks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.27,0:27:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但起初并没出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at first it wasn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.70,0:27:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很想他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.90,0:27:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在家听到他说话的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just hear him at the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.67,0:27:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.15,0:27:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我一个人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是能感到他靠近 因为我会觉得冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can always tell he's coming because I get these chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.51,0:27:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.60,0:27:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.02,0:27:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.64,0:27:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最开始…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first it's like…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.65,0:27:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道自己疯了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I was crazy, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.34,0:27:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.75,0:27:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很想念他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.44,0:27:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.68,0:27:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始说他很寂寞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He started saying he was lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.32,0:27:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he started to get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.52,0:27:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天他开始尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day he started yelling,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.39,0:27:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想逃走 但门已经被锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I tried to run but the door was locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我转过身 整个房间都着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I turned around, the whole room was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点就死在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.67,0:27:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么帮得了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能让你哥哥安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can put your brother to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.23,0:27:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:27:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被困在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.86,0:28:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说真的吗 就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real? Like …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.35,0:28:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.69,0:28:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我凭什么相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.07,0:28:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's your only shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.19,0:28:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.86,0:28:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.12,0:28:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你哥哥 是火葬还是土葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your brother … was he cremated? Buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.11,0:28:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,火葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cremated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.05,0:28:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还留着他的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you have anything of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.30,0:28:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 他亲手为我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This. He made it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.46,0:28:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他手还伤着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a busted hand, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.72,0:28:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是射箭的时候把手割伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sliced it open doing stupid archery.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面还有他的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bled on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.74,0:28:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.87,0:28:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. That's … that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.49,0:28:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.44,0:28:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能找个打火机来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any chance in hell you got a lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.36,0:28:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静得让我不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}This silence is very uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.00,0:28:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么要告诉我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something I should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.83,0:29:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.37,0:29:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.12,0:29:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格就有这气场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg has that effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.97,0:29:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人很不爽 晓得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awkward. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.54,0:29:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定让你很不便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be difficult for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.89,0:29:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩在说笑呢 伊曼纽尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's making a joke, Emanuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.08,0:29:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.10,0:29:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you score that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.10,0:29:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,从马科斯的口袋里取出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grabbed it out of Marcus' pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.76,0:29:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我关在这里倒成了犯罪高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being locked up is really turning me into a decent criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.09,0:29:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得画个圈出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're laying down a circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.63,0:29:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me open these, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.56,0:29:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得自己来搞定这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to do this on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.90,0:29:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事没事 我只是有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm okay. I'm just having a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.80,0:29:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 药物反应 - 眼花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brown acid moment… - Dizzy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.99,0:30:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.03,0:30:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的 你死了就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely. When your heart stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.11,0:30:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 现在我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Now, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.93,0:30:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起站在圈内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me in the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.79,0:30:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.67,0:30:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么情况 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.81,0:30:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.03,0:30:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个手链给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.29,0:30:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛琳 求你别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marin, don't do this. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.61,0:30:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛琳 把手链给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marin, give me the bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.23,0:30:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.12,0:30:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.22,0:30:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.69,0:30:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.70,0:31:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 现在感觉怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? How you feeling now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.15,0:31:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂有损伤 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}His soul is broken, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.11,0:31:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给开点药吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give him a pill?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.80,0:31:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法再对你用药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't give you any more medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.49,0:31:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则很可能会过量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The potential for overdose is too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.27,0:31:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得考虑用手术解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk about surgical solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.37,0:31:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surgical?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.34,0:31:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,额叶切除术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Lobotomy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.62,0:31:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 不是额叶切除术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. We're not talking lobotomy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.68,0:31:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.64,0:31:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.82,0:31:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听得见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.30,0:31:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.75,0:31:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.78,0:31:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真见鬼 好多恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.68,0:31:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.09,0:31:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是福不是祸 是祸躲不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No grass growing under your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.20,0:31:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有几把那种刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of those knives do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.47,0:31:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.42,0:32:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 抱歉 我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, forgive me, but what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.89,0:32:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.85,0:32:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他办法能搞定这么多恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got any other ideas how we could blast through that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.29,0:32:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.66,0:32:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个去啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for the love of…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.90,0:32:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆在里头呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.57,0:32:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你与老友重逢不胜欢喜 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're enjoying the double dip with your old pal, but …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.20,0:32:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为像你想的那么简单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's that cut and dry?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.39,0:32:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.58,0:32:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他都干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.52,0:32:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你告诉他 他能像个没事人一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to tell him and just hope that he takes it in stride?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.23,0:32:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他会崩溃 或者消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could snap. He could…disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.25,0:32:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.39,0:32:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说我们认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gather we know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.77,0:32:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a dollop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.55,0:32:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我吧 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell me. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.40,0:32:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.35,0:32:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解自己 但我认识你很多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just met yourself. I've known you for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.44,0:32:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.74,0:32:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你是在挑逗我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry? Is that a flirtation?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.87,0:32:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我说的是个物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a species.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.85,0:32:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有强大的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very powerful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.85,0:32:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.44,0:32:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你能治愈别人的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? That's why you heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.96,0:32:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你不吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.87,0:32:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定还有其他特异功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.36,0:33:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.74,0:33:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个天使 听起来很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being an angel … it sounds pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.26,0:33:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不好 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.30,0:33:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,血腥残杀 腐化堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bloody. It's corrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.87,0:33:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.86,0:33:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些他都知道 你们曾并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would know. You used to fight together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.39,0:33:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都称得上是闺蜜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bestest friends, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.82,0:33:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're…friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.75,0:33:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是小卡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.78,0:33:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全没印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.21,0:33:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得你了 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember you. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.81,0:33:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你身怀神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. You got the juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.11,0:33:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把那边的所有的恶魔都消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can smite every demon in that lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.59,0:33:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不记得应该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't remember how.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.90,0:33:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有这能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.89,0:33:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信就像骑自行车一样简单自如\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's just like riding a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.92,0:33:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我也不知道怎么骑车啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to do that, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.01,0:34:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我会试试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.61,0:34:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't gonna go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.89,0:34:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得说不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.47,0:34:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺相信这小天使的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in the little tree topper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.22,0:34:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.02,0:34:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.89,0:34:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.07,0:34:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.42,0:35:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我的好小伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.05,0:35:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑也没有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think running will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.99,0:35:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was beautiful, Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.91,0:35:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.06,0:35:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记起你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.93,0:35:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都记起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.13,0:35:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我犯下的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.49,0:35:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变成的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I became.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.90,0:35:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.62,0:35:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为萨姆在里面 就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Sam is dying in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.16,0:35:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.05,0:35:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.85,0:36:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了这么多人都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.94,0:36:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass. Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.21,0:36:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.07,0:36:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.46,0:36:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 这是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where … where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.50,0:36:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,电休克疗法治疗室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electroshock therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.91,0:36:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先把你安顿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get you settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.21,0:36:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕 这方法可帮了不少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be freaked. I've seen this help a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.33,0:36:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.34,0:36:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.74,0:36:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说 使用的电流强度很低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ordinarily, they keep this thing set on low.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.63,0:36:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想我们可以做点试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was thinking we could experiment a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.95,0:36:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.20,0:36:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头绑好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get that head strapped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.88,0:36:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还记得的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.18,0:37:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就该知道你当时已经极力挽救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you know you did the best you could at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.60,0:37:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为我辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't defend me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.29,0:37:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道天堂里有多少人员伤亡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea the death toll in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.84,0:37:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,人间又有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.00,0:37:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们告别的时候很不愉快 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't part friends, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.70,0:37:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.50,0:37:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserved to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.07,0:37:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能挽救局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I can't possibly fix it…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.68,0:37:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,又何必从那条河里走出来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did I even walk out of that river?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.71,0:37:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是为了挽救局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.08,0:37:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.65,0:37:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.29,0:37:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是能忍啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just take those lickin's, don't you, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.64,0:37:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是烤肉都能烤熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it's meat, you can cook it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.76,0:37:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得调大点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got to turn up the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.97,0:38:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当初不应该摧毁你的屏障的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have broken your wall, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.90,0:38:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我弥补自己的过失吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.81,0:38:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.92,0:38:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.96,0:38:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.84,0:38:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三只小猪很聪明嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that third little pig was smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.13,0:38:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,出门找了点砖头来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went out and got some bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.08,0:38:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你做不到是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you mean you can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.00,0:38:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说剩下的东西不足以重建屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean there's nothing left to rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.85,0:38:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.58,0:38:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它崩塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it crumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.67,0:38:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他脑子里现在发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pieces got crushed to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.29,0:38:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把碎片都碾成渣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by whatever's happening inside his head right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.20,0:39:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说没有别的法子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying there's nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.48,0:39:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到死都是这幅鬼样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he's gonna be like this until his candle blows out?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.16,0:39:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.41,0:39:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让这个问题消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a problem I can make disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.98,0:39:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里也清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.02,0:39:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也许可以将它转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I may be able to shift it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.45,0:39:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shift?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.22,0:39:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这可以让萨姆重新振作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it would get Sam back on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.59,0:39:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.74,0:39:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.65,0:39:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 小卡 你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Cass, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.15,0:39:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.24,0:39:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能会有点疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.78,0:39:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没机会再对你说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I can't tell you again…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.76,0:39:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对我所做的深表抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I ever did this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.89,0:40:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.69,0:40:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean! - Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.92,0:40:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.35,0:40:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.70,0:40:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello…Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.74,0:40:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.91,0:40:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这样丢下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.31,0:40:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能带着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can't bring him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.06,0:40:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界上的妖魔鬼怪都在找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything on the planet's out for us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.11,0:40:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果走漏了风声 我们可保护不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word gets out, we can't protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.12,0:40:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能置他于险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.46,0:40:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样安全点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.93,0:40:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有知道小卡的事的恶魔都死绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every demon who knows about Cass is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.24,0:40:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有没死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.63,0:40:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 迪恩 你这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, this whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.11,0:40:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,「敌人的敌人就是我的朋友」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Enemy of my enemy is my friend" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.65,0:40:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉就像个恶魔契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}feels kind of like a demon deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.83,0:40:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是个契约 这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a deal. It's …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.90,0:40:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.17,0:40:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,握着对方的致命把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutually assured destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.84,0:41:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我明白 她不是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I get it. She's not our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.06,0:41:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.65,0:41:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的朋友都死绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All our friends are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.78,0:41:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你资历很深\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you certainly have experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.00,0:41:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不赖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.68,0:41:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何想加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}why do you want to join our staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.12,0:41:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮助患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really just want to help the patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.83,0:41:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,照料他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.64,0:41:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我自夸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to be immodest,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.86,0:41:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得我能起很大作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I feel like I'd make a great fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.37,0:41:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't argue with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.53,0:41:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the team…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.52,0:41:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,马斯特斯护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse Masters.
